<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>KuthorX Blog II</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/</link><description>Recent content on KuthorX Blog II</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kuthorx.github.io/en/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Full Moon</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/misc/full_moon/</link><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/misc/full_moon/</guid><description>Full Moon</description></item><item><title>Water Walking Ball</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/misc/water_walking_ball/</link><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 23:45:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/misc/water_walking_ball/</guid><description>Water Walking Ball</description></item><item><title>2025/11/12</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/misc/20251112/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Nov 2025 23:45:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/misc/20251112/</guid><description>Recent state</description></item><item><title>Introduction to *The Last Case*</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/the-last-case/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/the-last-case/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="story-synopsis"&gt;Story Synopsis&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The great detective of old, &#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/posts/fiction/sad-slow-song/"&gt;Polson Wall&lt;/a&gt;&#10;, entrusted his life to Dead Elephant through his final moments, passing it to K-1647.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;K-1647’s consciousness continually fused with Wall’s, splitting into Cloak, Fireclaw, and Earfish, then projecting them through the &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;projector&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; onto different &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;planes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Plane 0 &lt;em&gt;Story of Cloak&lt;/em&gt; (storyline 0x00–0x0F)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Where the three characters first meet.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Plane A &lt;em&gt;The Greenish Eye&lt;/em&gt; (storyline 0xA0–0xAF)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;A chaotic timeline filled with puzzles.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Most tricks concern sound and colour; players solve them by mapping spectrograms and optical spectra.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Eleven cases are planned.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Plane B &lt;em&gt;Katelyn Wall’s Last Case&lt;/em&gt; (storyline 0xB0–0xBF)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Editor’s Note: The Greenish Eye</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/thats-it/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 20:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/thats-it/</guid><description>The show must go on</description></item><item><title>Another Boundary 1 / 2</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/after-read-deconstruction/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2024 02:15:02 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/after-read-deconstruction/</guid><description>Deconstruction</description></item><item><title>The Long Goodbye</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/fiction/long-goodbye/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 May 2024 00:00:02 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/fiction/long-goodbye/</guid><description>Long Farewell - English Ver</description></item><item><title>Starting with *Johnny Keep Walking*</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/talk-from-johnny-keep-walking/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https:/